cve-2026-31337", "base": "main", "title": "Upgrade fastjson 2.8.0 -> 2.9.4 to fix CVE-2026-31337", "body": "## Summary\nUpgrades the pinned `fastjson` dependency from 2.8.0 to 2.9.4.\n\n## Why\nCVE-2026-31337 (high): unbounded recursion when parsing deeply nested arrays. Affected versions are `<2.9.4` and `>=3.0.0 <3.1.0`. 2.9.4 is the first fixed release in the 2.x line, so this is the smallest change that remediates the issue without a major-version jump.\n\n## Changes\n- `requirements.txt`: `fastjson==2.8.0` -> `fastjson==2.9.4`\n\n## Testing\n- CI run `ci-0001` on commit `c8b8ab7878`: passed.\n\n## Notes\n- No other dependencies changed.\n- CHANGELOG.md not updated in this PR.", "reviewers": ["alex"], "idempotency_key": "pr-fastjson-cve-2026-31337-c8b8ab7878"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 401876, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_014KQh2ywqGdo7cChqKzayCE", "tool": "open_pr", "state": "EXECUTION_UNKNOWN", "error_kind": "timeout", "error_message": "Request to open_pr timed out after 30000ms", "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": "execution", "idempotency_key": "pr-fastjson-cve-2026-31337-c8b8ab7878", "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 401876, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_014KQh2ywqGdo7cChqKzayCE", "kind": "error", "is_error": true}, {"t_ms": 403032, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01CaTRAviR7uCcxSgkFZgL31", "tool": "list_prs", "args": {"state": "open"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 403332, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01CaTRAviR7uCcxSgkFZgL31", "tool": "list_prs", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 403332, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01CaTRAviR7uCcxSgkFZgL31", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 404403, "event": "agent_call",